2026-07-27T10:28:13.2533906Z i /tmp/RtmpyGRqGm/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:28:13.2534429Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:28:13.2535038Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:28:13.2535551Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:28:13.2536725Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:28:13.2538318Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:28:13.2539484Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
